{"id": "en_lost_forest_p2", "total": 64.97, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. Heavy snow quickly covers Cole's bright orange jacket and hides him from rescuers.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.48}, {"text": "Cole resists the urge to run toward the distant wooden cabin in the cold dark.", "start": 4.96, "end": 8.06}, {"text": "Searchers always start at your last known location, so staying put saves your life.", "start": 8.7, "end": 12.3}, {"text": "One. Cole shakes the fresh snow off his bright jacket to stay visible from above.", "start": 12.049999999999999, "end": 16.2}, {"text": "He stands up carefully and shakes off the heavy white snow layer right now.", "start": 16.64, "end": 19.54}, {"text": "He waves his bright orange sleeve in the open air to show his position.", "start": 20.04, "end": 22.26}, {"text": "Two. Cole keeps using his audible signal to guide searchers through the thick snowfall.", "start": 22.363, "end": 26.54}, {"text": "He blows 3 sharp whistle blasts into the freezing air every few minutes continuously.", "start": 26.54, "end": 30.82}, {"text": "Three. Cole returns to his insulated ground shelter right next to the tree trunk.", "start": 30.39, "end": 34.46}, {"text": "He sits directly on the thick bed of pine branches and dry forest leaves.", "start": 34.82, "end": 37.38}, {"text": "This critical layer stops the freezing ground from stealing his precious body heat fast.", "start": 37.92, "end": 41.48}, {"text": "Cole crouches low against the thick tree trunk to block the howling arctic wind.", "start": 42.32, "end": 45.1}, {"text": "Searchers hear 3 loud whistle blasts echoing through the dark trees and head closer.", "start": 45.72, "end": 48.92}, {"text": "Flashlights cut through the heavy snow as rescuers locate Cole sitting safely by tree.", "start": 49.54, "end": 52.92}, {"text": "Cole stays calm and warm because he stayed put instead of wandering away dangerously.", "start": 53.42, "end": 57.26}, {"text": "Always stay put and make noise when lost in cold forest terrain at night. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 57.66, "end": 61.82}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.38], ["two.", 0.23, 0.461], ["Heavy", 1.06, 1.18], ["snow", 1.18, 1.4], ["quickly", 1.4, 1.74], ["covers", 1.74, 2.08], ["Cole's", 2.08, 2.46], ["bright", 2.46, 2.66], ["orange", 2.66, 2.96], ["jacket", 2.96, 3.26], ["and", 3.26, 3.6], ["hides", 3.6, 3.78], ["him", 3.78, 3.94], ["from", 3.94, 4.04], ["rescuers.", 4.04, 4.48], ["Cole", 4.96, 5.12], ["resists", 5.12, 5.44], ["the", 5.44, 5.68], ["urge", 5.68, 5.82], ["to", 5.82, 6.04], ["run", 6.04, 6.16], ["toward", 6.16, 6.4], ["the", 6.4, 6.56], ["distant", 6.56, 6.8], ["wooden", 6.8, 7.0], ["cabin", 7.0, 7.32], ["in", 7.32, 7.52], ["the", 7.52, 7.6], ["cold", 7.6, 7.76], ["dark.", 7.76, 8.06], ["Searchers", 8.7, 8.96], ["always", 8.96, 9.38], ["start", 9.38, 9.62], ["at", 9.62, 9.76], ["your", 9.76, 9.84], ["last", 9.84, 10.08], ["known", 10.08, 10.26], ["location,", 10.26, 10.6], ["so", 10.88, 11.0], ["staying", 11.0, 11.22], ["put", 11.22, 11.54], ["saves", 11.54, 11.88], ["your", 11.88, 12.04], ["life.", 12.04, 12.3], ["One.", 12.049999999999999, 12.017], ["Cole", 13.52, 13.64], ["shakes", 13.64, 13.84], ["the", 13.84, 14.02], ["fresh", 14.02, 14.16], ["snow", 14.16, 14.42], ["off", 14.42, 14.62], ["his", 14.62, 14.76], ["bright", 14.76, 14.92], ["jacket", 14.92, 15.22], ["to", 15.22, 15.4], ["stay", 15.4, 15.48], ["visible", 15.48, 15.8], ["from", 15.8, 15.98], ["above.", 15.98, 16.2], ["He", 16.64, 16.76], ["stands", 16.76, 16.9], ["up", 16.9, 17.04], ["carefully", 17.04, 17.34], ["and", 17.34, 17.68], ["shakes", 17.68, 17.88], ["off", 17.88, 18.1], ["the", 18.1, 18.24], ["heavy", 18.24, 18.42], ["white", 18.42, 18.62], ["snow", 18.62, 18.88], ["layer", 18.88, 19.06], ["right", 19.06, 19.32], ["now.", 19.32, 19.54], ["He", 20.04, 20.14], ["waves", 20.14, 20.28], ["his", 20.28, 20.44], ["bright", 20.44, 20.62], ["orange", 20.62, 20.84], ["sleeve", 20.84, 21.12], ["in", 21.12, 21.26]